384","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"It's Sports Day at Hyakki Academy! A scavenger hunt relay, mandragora toss... plenty of youkai-themed events! A fiery battle over Class 2-3's victory and Haruaki's xxxx begins now!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-11-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mVtKjvyFgRr7EB6e37Mj2sfkd4Z.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mVtKjvyFgRr7EB6e37Mj2sfkd4Z.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/259788/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"5658385","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"It's Sports Day at Hyakki Academy part 2! Class 2-3 is struggling at 3rd place, but they're trying to get to 1st place with the obstacle course relay. But an accident occurs and steers the event into an unexpected direction.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-11-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u5mDKZfwQWHzdsBtyFPZy9V5Q5P.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u5mDKZfwQWHzdsBtyFPZy9V5Q5P.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/259788/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"5658386","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Amaaki, Haruaki's twin brother, takes his place and becomes a teacher for a day. Soon after, Yanagida's love potion cause havoc at the school. And to finish the episode off, the whole class goes to a public bath.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-11-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2xYx5Co9BFyX8DIIySe9qLc63yK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2xYx5Co9BFyX8DIIySe9qLc63yK.