"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9HE10sIRkAHgQQdsyUuxAt5o88J.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9HE10sIRkAHgQQdsyUuxAt5o88J.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/259788/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"5658391","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kaminarimon and Tokyo Tower! Class 2-3's excitement over their Tokyo field trip comes to a sudden halt when Haruaki gets swept away by a wave of salarymen into the subway and gets lost. The students split up to find him but Sano gets a really bad feeling.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-12-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fJySTP4C5VyH2xeHU6TtKP1SI4.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fJySTP4C5VyH2xeHU6TtKP1SI4.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/259788/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"5658392","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Summer vacation is finally here! Hijita and Rensuke enjoy Beniko's special shaved ice, while Mamekichi and Tamao go catch some bugs. Meanwhile, Haruaki goes to a bookstore where Sano works and is recommended a book but that ends up causing havoc!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-01-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/71OswoOzxxSYsqxd0stSAfc8pfA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/71OswoOzxxSYsqxd0stSAfc8pfA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/259788/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"5658393","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"During the middle of summer vacation, Beniko's family home that's a